title: Remove basic collator
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Related to https://github.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/pull/12172

    Closes: https://github.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/issues/8145

    This PR:
    - removes the basic collator
    - removes `collation_req_v1_receiver`
    - removes `CollatorSybilResistance`
    - removes `RequireSecondedInBlockAnnounce`

    These are not used anymore
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-aura
  bump: patch
- name: cumulus-relay-chain-minimal-node
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-service
  bump: patch
- name: cumulus-client-service
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: patch
- name: cumulus-client-network
  bump: patch
